{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of boys in a school is 3 times the number of girls and the number of girls is 9 times the number of teachers. Let us denote with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" />, the number of boys, girls and teachers respectively. Then the total number of boys, girls and teachers equals to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc267f0f33aec95b7a211bf4ea54764cdb324f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 31b\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\frac{37b}{27}\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 13g\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\frac{37g}{27}\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\frac{37t}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"439\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/312050d0fbbd8aa2c893d8c757356116a4157e53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g=\\frac{b}3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/5/935b272d396d80fcd157d39bf3223c66c99ee2ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=\\frac{b}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"51\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/f/5efdff5ddc9a4fb81e2dff833b83cba60ca58c0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=b+\\frac{b}{3}+\\frac{b}{27}=\\frac{37b}{27}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"229\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_25\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_27\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=